по образцу operations: `phpunit.xml`, `phpstan.neon` (`tmpDir: ../../build/phpstan/<dir>`), `README.md`,
`CHANGELOG.md` (`## Unreleased — extracted from corex/operations (PLAN3 P02)`), `composer-dependency-analyser.php`.
